Original work
--------------
HALOFLUX (https://github.com/Ryder191/haloflux) is the origin of the canvas
light-field visualisation in `src/engine.js`: the ring composition, the layered
light beams, the data-panel language, the motion timing and the color treatment
are the original author's work and remain licensed under the PolyForm
Noncommercial License 1.0.0 (see `LICENSE`).

This port
---------
The DeepSeek Harness integration is written for this project: the plugin
packaging (bundle row, client module), the live session adapter
(`src/live.js`), the HUD (`src/hud.js`), the settings page
(`src/settings.js`), the shared parameter store (`src/state.js`), the
three-level data capture dial, and the DSH-specific tuning of the engine.

Redistribution must keep this NOTICE and `LICENSE` together with the source.

